## Local app data (never commit secrets, samples, or user history)
## Note: runtime data lives under %LOCALAPPDATA%\MalwareAnalyzer, outside this
## repo, so these patterns are anchored to the repo root to avoid accidentally
## matching source folders with the same name (e.g. src/.../Secrets/).
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
appsettings.local.json
/secrets/
/data/history/
/data/samples/
/data/reports/
*.log

